{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-worked-examples-table6-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-worked-examples-table6-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 6 from tm-worked-examples","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-worked-examples"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-worked-examples-table6-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:tm-worked-examples-table6-data\"></a><p>The two crossings extracted from the worked examples are listed below. The <strong>Crossing</strong> column gives the index pair labelling the crossing; <strong>Parent type</strong> records its proton–neutron classification; and <strong>Matrix</strong> names the transfer matrix that governs it. Both crossings are classified as proton–neutron \"mix\" crossings, so both rows resolve to the mix transfer matrix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{\\mathrm{mix}}</code>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Crossing</th>\n<th>Parent type</th>\n<th>Matrix</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{p}</code>-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{n}</code> = mix</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{\\mathrm{mix}}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{p}</code>-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{n}</code> = mix</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{\\mathrm{mix}}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-mass-binding-algorithms/tm-worked-examples-table6-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-tm-worked-examples-table6-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":41,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":0}}}
